// # WebAssembly GC, Component Model and Native JIT Facade
//
// Logline: Unified standard library facade re-exporting WebAssembly GC runtime, Component Model canonical ABI, and Native JIT compiler infrastructure.
//
// Setup: Pure module shim importing all 49 Wasm GC, Component Model, and JIT companion submodules.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import Wasm GC type hierarchy, object memory layout, casting, and runtime memory collectors.
//   2. Import Component Model canonical ABI, WIT parser, resource tables, and composition linkers.
//   3. Import Machine IR, linear scan register allocator, native instruction encoders, and tiered execution runtime.

